characters are trademarks of their respective owners.

This repository contains no game data: no ROM, no graphics, no Japanese script.
Language packs store a translation next to a one-way fingerprint of the line it
replaces. The tools read the files from your own legally obtained cartridge
dump and cannot obtain the game for you.

Prior art this project builds on, with thanks:

- Normmatt & contributors, "Medarot-Navi-GBA-Translation"
  (https://github.com/Normmatt/Medarot-Navi-GBA-Translation): the character
  table this project's charset files were derived from, the script-bytecode
  opcode sizes reimplemented in navi/script.py, the "Malias" graphics codec
  ported to navi/gfx.py from Malias2.cs, and the Kabuto-release addresses in
  navi/rom.py taken from that repository's .definelabel tables. That
  repository targets the Kabuto release; this one re-derives all offsets from
  the dump it is given.
- The mGBA project (https://mgba.io): tools/gbashot links against libmgba for
  headless verification.

Please do not open issues or pull requests containing game files or the
original Japanese text.
